{"unit_id": "tag:04I0:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n迄今我们尚未讨论平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）景（site）的函子性（functoriality），换言之，给定概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）时会发生什么。精确的形式讨论见《拓扑（Topologies）》第<REF_0001>节。本节和随后几节将专门在小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）景（sites）的情形下简要讨论这些内容。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。我们得到函子（functor）<MATH_0002>。这个函子（functor）有以下重要性质<STRUCT_0004>\n<STRUCT_0005><MATHSEG_0001>终对象（final object）<MATHSEG_0002>终对象（final object）<MATHSEG_0003>，\n<STRUCT_0006><MATH_0003>保持纤维积（fibre products），\n<STRUCT_0007>若<MATH_0004>是<MATH_0005>中的覆盖（covering），则<MATH_0006>是<MATH_0007>中的覆盖（covering）。\n<STRUCT_0008>\n这些性质都容易验证（略）。由此我们得到所谓的<TEXTITOPEN_0001>景的态射（morphism of sites）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001><MATH_0008>，见《景（Sites）》定义<REF_0002>及《景（Sites）》命题<REF_0003>。使用平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）层（sheaves）及平展上同调（<ACCENT_0004>tale cohomology）时，无须详细了解这个抽象概念。通常只需知道，平展（<ACCENT_0005>tale）层（sheaves）上有函子（functors）<MATH_0009>（前推（pushforward））和<MATH_0010>（拉回（pullback）），并了解它们的一些简单性质。我们将在随后几节讨论这些性质，但有时会引用更抽象的材料来给出证明，因为那里往往是证明这些性质的自然情境。\n\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "<ACCENT_0001>tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "functoriality", "target_term": "函子性"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "small", "target_term": "小"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0002>tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "final object", "target_term": "终对象"}, {"source_term": "final object", "target_term": "终对象"}, {"source_term": "fibre products", "target_term": "纤维积"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target